WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
BUILD 014. THE TOOL PRODUCED AN ANSWER.. That does not tell you who researched, interpreted, inferred, decided, or approved.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
SEPARATE THE WORK. RESEARCH · INTERPRETATION · INFERENCE. Each layer needs sources, supervision, authority, and a record.

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
PROTECT JUDGMENT. STRATEGY · ADVICE · APPROVAL. Professional judgment remains owned by the responsible lawyer.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
KEEP CLIENT AUTHORITY. THE CLIENT STILL DECIDES.. Objectives and choices allocated to the client are not tool decisions.

5
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
SUPERVISION. REVIEW · CHANGE · STOP · RECORD. A label is not control unless the lawyer can actually change the outcome.

6
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
SAVE THIS. RESPONSIBILITY DOES NOT MOVE WITH THE TEXT.. Applicable jurisdictional rules and competent supervising counsel control.

